  "description": "The Klassd.Workflows worker host: WorkerHost.RunAsync() is the executor-pod entry point that loads the requested IJob from the assemblies beside it and runs it against the stdout protocol. Reference this from a thin exe plus your job assemblies to build your own worker image, or layer your job DLLs onto the published base image. Implement IWorkerStartup for constructor-injected jobs.",
